{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817","id":2959117155,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6QtHv7","number":104817,"title":"Reduce memory footprint of virtual methods","user":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-03-30T21:43:45Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T17:56:26Z","closed_at":"2025-04-03T17:55:37Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104817.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"I noticed that for each virtual methods we were allocating 3 different non-static variables:\r\n- A StringName for the name of the method.\r\n- A void pointer for the GDExtension callback.\r\n- A boolean to check if the callback was set.\r\n\r\nTaking into account memory alignment, this is a cost of 24 bytes of memory per virtual method per instance, which adds up quickly.\r\nFor example, Node has 10 virtual methods, which means a cost 240 bytes per instance, even if you don't use any extension.\r\n\r\nI removed the boolean and _replaced its associated use with a null pointer check_**( Edit: This approach was wrong. I changed it afterward, see next messages)**. The StringName is now static to avoid allocating one per instance as well.\r\nThis reduces the memory cost of a virtual method to 8 bytes per instance, reducing the total size by 160 bytes for Node, and 280 bytes for Control (picked those examples as they are the most common to use).\r\n\r\nNode:\r\n- master: 1072 Bytes\r\n- PR: 912 Bytes\r\n\r\nControl:\r\n- master: 2560 Bytes\r\n- PR: 2240 Bytes\r\n\r\nAnother example for a class that is mostly made of virtual methods:\r\n\r\nPhysicsDirectBodyState3DExtension :\r\n- master: 1520 Bytes\r\n- PR: 784 Bytes\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"CedNaru","id":31470327,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNDcwMzI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31470327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru","html_url":"https://github.com/CedNaru","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CedNaru/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104817/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/1